node_modules
dist

# Sample/fixture JSON is tracked deliberately. A global `*.json` ignore
# (core.excludesFile) would otherwise silently drop newly-added fixtures and
# break CI on a fresh checkout (imports resolve to missing modules).
!packages/samples/src/**/*.json

# The generator's curated input, which the negation above did not reach — so
# `orig-wines.json` and friends were never committed and a fresh clone could not
# run `generate:seeds` at all. The generated seeds are only reproducible if the
# source they are generated FROM is in the repo.
!packages/samples/generator/*.json
